Ũhoro wa Gũthondekwo wa Synix na ũhoro wa Gũthondekwo wa Discord no ũcokerio thĩinĩ wa PC ĩyo njerũ na ciugo ici cia gũthondekwo. Ĩrũmagie o hamwe na ũhoro ũcio; Ti ũndũ mũhũthũ gũcokererio.

Synix nĩ yaatwarirũo:

{0}

Faili ĩno ndĩhithĩtwo, nĩ ũndũ ũcio ĩigĩre handũ hangĩ. Synix-marĩĩtwa ma kũmenyerera na Discord Webhooks no ĩbatare kũingĩrio rĩngĩ thĩinĩ wa PC ĩngĩ.

